Walked along the dike before breakfast. The wind came hard from the west and the sky was **grey** all the way to the horizon.  
Saw two herons.

Back home I made coffee and read the paper. Nothing much in it, except a long piece about the new bridge, which apparently will be finished *next year*.

Later I want to write more about the walk. See also [[Notes]].
